WEBVTT

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.000
Tonight is Christmas.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.510
On this Holy Night...

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:15.510
Let's speak of love.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.850
We can see each other whenever we want to, but...

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.520
We're too close to exchange whispers of love.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.040
But even then, I'll say it.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.050
You're the one...

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:28.720
You're the one...

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:29.920
...I love.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:39.290
That's who we are--siblings.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.040
<i>Can't stop loving!</i>

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:50.310
<i>I love you 24/7!</i>

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:52.280
<i>You're my sweet heaven♂♀</i>

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.920
<i>Into you all year round!</i>

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:57.080
<i>Are you gonna be my girl!!</i>

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>Make the first move for the win!</i>
<i>Situation still unclear</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:13.600
<i>Every day is full of love wars (Trouble love)</i>

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.600
"Watch for Pitfall Traps"

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>And here's the arrival of the rivals</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:24.080
<i>Moving in fast, the strands</i> <i>of love get super-duper tangled</i>

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:23.910
"Do Not Stop"

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:26.580
<i>More than anyone ever (Believe my eyes)</i>

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:29.120
<i>I'll cherish you (True my heart)</i>

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:34.590
<i>Wrapping you up...</i>

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:39.490
<i>Sweeter than a kiss ✭</i>

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:41.430
<i>Every day! Every night!</i>

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:44.700
<i>I'll be there for all seasons!</i>

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.630
<i>What a wonderful world</i>

00:01:46.630 --> 00:01:49.870
<i>The days we've spent are all anniversaries</i>

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:51.840
<i>Can't stop loving!</i>

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:55.010
<i>I want to protect your smile!</i>

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:57.010
<i>You're my sweet heaven♂♀</i>

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.150
<i>Transcending destiny</i>

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:01.640
<i>Are you gonna be my girl!!</i>

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:06.320
"Siblings Excluded!"

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:13.920
"Watch for Squirrels"

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:24.170
Make sure there's no gap between your shoe and the heel cup.

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:28.640
Lift your heel up a bit, like this.
And then stomp down to push it in.

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:31.810
Lift up a bit and stomp down...

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.550
You tighten the straps starting at the ankle.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:39.820
It's hard to snowboard if things are wobbly here

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:41.090
and it's dangerous.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:42.020
Okay.

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:44.490
You want to try doing the other one yourself?

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:51.000
What do you think? Is it still too loose?

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.590
I think it's good.

00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:58.270
Natsume.

00:02:58.270 --> 00:02:59.510
Natsu-bro.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:02.040
You two still haven't gotten any snowboarding in?

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:03.910
We're still getting ready here.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.780
You're really good at snowboarding, aren't you, Natsume?

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:10.020
You think so?
I'm just kind of doing my own thing.

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.120
Plus, I'm self-taught.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:14.390
Not at all. You looked cool.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.920
Yeah? Well, thanks.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:19.890
Did you rent that?

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:21.430
Oh, yes.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.930
If I remember right, this is your first time snowboarding, right?

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:26.230
Wouldn't a shorter board be better?

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:28.740
What? It would?

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.640
They didn't have any left.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:32.310
The rental shop was packed.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:35.780
But I picked the one that looked the best.

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:39.750
Hmm, I wonder if
Yu's selection is to be trusted.

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.050
Kaname.

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:42.780
Who the heck says things like that?

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.790
Besides, we planned this trip in the last two days,

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.750
so there's no way we could've prepped.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.790
But everything is about luck and chance.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:52.660
Even our being here right now is fate, after all.

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:56.000
I guess even the really nice snow we've got is fate, too.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:01.800
Yup. Right now, we're blessed with the fate to fully enjoy these slopes.

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:05.010
Come on, Little Sis,
I'll give you step-by-step instructions.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:07.580
Hey, now!

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.840
I'm teaching her!

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:13.150
What? Are you sure you're not hungry, Yu?

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.820
The way you're all irritated like that...

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.340
So not hungry!

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:19.790
Come on, shall we go, Little Sis?

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.260
What? Um...

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.930
That's enough already. Quit hanging around.

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:27.530
I'm not hanging around you, Yu.
I'm hanging around Little Sis.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.500
So, like, that's what I'm telling to stop.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.520
And why would that be?

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.350
You okay?

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.510
Thank you for that.

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:51.350
Am I going to be able to snowboard at this rate?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.790
It's easy.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:55.060
If you want, I'll teach you.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.360
What? Uh, but...

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:01.130
Yu, how about we losers go snowboarding?

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:02.830
No, I'm staying here!

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:05.500
Just let it go.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:07.800
Hey, Kana-bro, this is dangerous!
It's dangerous!

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.200
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey! No! No!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.410
You can snowboard with them in the afternoon.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:14.410
First, we'll need to start with your posture.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.310
I'm a strict teacher.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:20.210
O-Okay. I look forward to your instruction.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:24.350
Right now, we siblings are at Naeba.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:27.020
As for how we ended up here...

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:34.930
It was the day before Christmas Eve.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:37.770
It's really too bad about Fu.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:41.000
This was a rare chance for all of us siblings to get together.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.370
There's <i>one</i> of us who's happy about it, though.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:45.670
Yeah! Talk about refreshing!

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:50.010
If only we could've at least delivered his dinner to him...

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.850
I definitely feel sorry for him.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:55.850
Your homemade roast beef is delicious, Little Sister.

00:05:55.850 --> 00:06:00.360
The one Kyo-bro makes every year is legit and delicious,

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.090
but Little Sis, yours is homey and nice.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.590
Thank you very much.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.590
Yeah, it's seriously good.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:09.290
Practically makes you want her for your bride, right?

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.790
B-Bride...?

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:16.200
Could I have a minute, you guys?

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:22.440
I'd still like to make some family time for Futo during Christmas.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:23.540
So, what do you think?

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:23.980
What?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:24.880
Gag.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.450
How?

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:30.450
Futo's concert venue tomorrow is a hotel in Naeba,

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:34.090
so I was thinking we should go, even if it's just those of us who can make it.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:37.590
Oh, a white Christmas? That sounds nice.

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:39.130
Right, Little Sister?

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:41.560
Yes, it would be wonderful.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.000
You'd like to go snowboarding, too.
Right, Yusuke?

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.630
Snowboarding? Well, sure...

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.100
I couldn't give a rat's ass about that bastard's concert, though.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:51.840
And so, the four of us, who had no plans the next day,

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:54.280
ended up making a last-minute trip to Naeba.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:58.480
Hikaru and Natsume were to join us later as well.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.820
Wataru really wanted to go,

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:06.280
but he had made plans with
Ms. Miwa, so that came first.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.200
You hit yourself somewhere?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.500
Oh, no, I'm so sorry.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.990
My thigh muscles are seizing up.

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.640
How about a quick break then?

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:27.810
I'm so sorry.

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:29.710
Why are you apologizing?

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:32.280
You're good at snowboarding,

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:35.280
so it must not be very fun having to be here with me...

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:37.650
That's not true.

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:39.950
Am I being a bad teacher?

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:42.690
Oh, no, I think you do a really good job.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:47.530
Because, I can even tell myself that I'm improving.

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:50.500
I see. Then I'm glad.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:53.670
I'm so bad about it.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:54.570
What?

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:58.340
I just get so intense when it comes to sports-related things.

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:02.340
I guess I think that if I'm going to do it, I want to be good at it.

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.340
That's so like you, Natsume.

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:06.980
You think?

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:08.070
Yes.

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:12.990
Hey!

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:14.560
Yusuke!

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:18.360
How's it going? You able to snowboard now?

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.520
Yeah. A little, at least.

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.870
Did you climb all the way up here on foot?

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:31.770
Yeah, couldn't exactly leave you two alone forever, so...

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:37.380
You're incredible...

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:39.410
Hey, let's go eat.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.280
What?

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:41.220
I don't mind, but...

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:43.020
Natsu-bro, you go snowboard.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:45.250
Right this minute. Okay?!

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:53.720
Yum!

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:58.730
Want some? It'll warm you up.

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:01.460
Oh, I have tea, so I'm good.

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.940
Now that you can snowboard a little,

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.280
how about trying an intermediate trail?

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.480
Hmm, I'd <i>like</i> to go, but...

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.880
It'll be fine. I'll be there to help you.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.750
Don't feel like you can depend on me?

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.150
No, no, that's not it.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:23.120
Just thinking about what if I can't make it down...

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:26.960
Then, I'll pick out the route.
You follow behind me.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.900
I feel like I might be able to manage that.

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:31.300
All right! It's settled then.
Let's give it a try.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.730
Okay.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:39.170
What is it?

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:41.470
I-It's nothing.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.510
Getting to go snowboarding just the two of us...

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:50.580
Maybe there really is a god.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.450
Oh, Hikaru.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:55.690
Hi, Little Sister.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:56.360
You.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:57.160
Ow!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.260
What the hell?

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:01.800
Were you letting your thoughts run amok again?

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:03.660
L-Leave me alone.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.970
Or more like, it's daytime and drinking already?

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:09.440
I have no interest in skiing or snowboarding, so...

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:11.430
What I'm interested in is...

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:20.510
Never mind. There is no god.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:26.350
If there is one...

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.290
I think maybe I've been forsaken.

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:30.690
D-Did you say something?!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:32.060
Nothing!

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:35.060
Or more like, I can't hear anything in this wind!

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:36.460
What?!

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:42.300
Normally, a trail like this would be no problem,

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:43.970
but it'll be dangerous in this blizzard.

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:45.840
We're going to head down slowly.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.140
Okay.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.880
Yusuke?!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.160
Hey!

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:15.900
Hey! What happened?!

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:24.940
Ow...

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.520
Little Sis!

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.470
Little Sis...

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:48.970
Kaname...

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:51.540
Look at how cold you are.

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:53.610
It's okay now.

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:55.610
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:59.450
The thing is, when I try to move, my foot...

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.140
Don't push it.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:04.090
Up we go.

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:06.590
Hold on tight so you don't fall off.

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:08.420
Okay.

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.760
Yeah, that's good.

00:12:12.760 --> 00:12:14.990
Come on, let's go back.

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:27.170
How's that? Does it hurt?

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:29.110
A little...

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:31.580
Yeah, it doesn't seem to be broken.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:33.310
I think you just twisted it,

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:36.580
so if you get some rest,
I think the pain will recede.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:39.750
And you only had a light case of hypothermia, so I'm glad.

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.620
Thank you very much.

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:44.130
If it's thanks, tell it to Kaname.

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.490
Really, thank you very much.

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:50.030
Kaname?

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:55.930
I don't want to see any more bad things happen to my family.

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:59.770
Bad things happening to the family?

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:01.810
I wonder what it could be...

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:04.150
I'm really sorry.

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.450
Because of me...

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.850
No way, it's not your fault.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:11.790
And <i>I'm</i> sorry for making you worry.

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:17.860
I'm going to move her to her room, so would you help me?

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:18.890
Sure.

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:22.700
Yusuke, call up room service and order a hot cocoa.

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.160
S-Sure.

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:28.000
Feeling better?

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:29.970
Yes.

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:33.640
But Kaname sure is cool, huh?

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:34.580
What?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:39.480
He usually seems kind of frivolous, but he's dependable when it matters.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:44.080
Rescuing a woman like that...

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:47.590
I don't think I could quite pull off something like that.

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:49.660
Um...

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.990
I don't have the words to say this well,

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:56.330
but there's something about you that encompasses us all

00:13:56.330 --> 00:14:00.320
and it's kind of like, just you being there is really reassuring...

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:05.670
When I'm in the dining room on the fifth floor, everyone asks,

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:08.680
"Where's Masa-bro?"

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:10.510
So, well...

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:15.850
Figuratively speaking, you're probably like the roof.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:16.950
The roof?

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:21.460
Normally, it's hard to appreciate how important a roof is, you know?

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:27.030
But it's the roof that protects the house from the sun and from the rain.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:31.370
When I said your presence was reassuring, I meant it like that.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:33.030
That makes me happy.

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:36.370
That makes me really happy. Thank you.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:37.770
Not at all.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:38.970
Oh, yeah.

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:42.310
The hot spring at this hotel is supposedly good for contusions,

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:44.210
so why don't you try going for a dip later?

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:46.750
We have the family bath reserved.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.380
Thank you very much.

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:53.290
--Also, we should probably cancel going to Futo's concert today.
--What?

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:55.620
Better not to push it.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.160
Okay.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:15:00.090
Well, get some good rest.

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:03.600
We'll go say hi to Futo and come back.

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:06.770
Okay, please give him my regards.

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:07.930
Sure.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:15.440
Is she okay?

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:19.350
Yeah, but she should get a little rest.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:21.850
I'm sure we can just cancel going to the concert.

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.580
Everyone, besides her, is going.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:25.450
Wh-What?!

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:31.590
After sleeping for a bit, the pain had lessened,

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:34.290
so I decided to try taking a dip in the family bath.

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:41.660
I wonder if Futo's concert is in full swing by now...

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:58.520
I was sure Masaomi said that the bath was reserved...

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.990
What should I do?

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.990
Good evening, Little Sister.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.830
Hikaru!

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.640
It's nice to do on occasion, isn't it?

00:16:14.640 --> 00:16:17.240
Sharing a bath, just us siblings...

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.210
Y-Yes...

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:24.680
Oh, come to think of it, did you know?

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:29.080
They're doing fireworks at 10 o'clock at the Christmas tree on the slopes.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:33.190
No, I didn't know.

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:36.360
If your foot seems okay, how about we go watch?

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:38.890
Uh, sure...

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.380
I'm going to head out first.

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:46.230
Watch your step.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.720
I will.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.960
Good evening, Sis.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.390
Futo!

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:16.460
What's with that look on your face?

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:19.370
When I've come all this way just to see you.

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:21.140
Is your concert over?

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:23.770
It's over. As of just a moment ago.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:26.140
And then I ran right over here.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:27.300
What?

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.870
I wanted to see you.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:34.210
I was worried.

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:36.580
Is your foot okay?

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:38.290
Yeah.

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:40.320
But it's too bad.

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:43.590
I wanted you to see the concert.

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:44.730
I'm sorry.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:50.230
No, it was stupid Yusuke's fault and not yours.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:52.830
But it made me a bit sad.

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:58.470
I'm sorry. It would've been fine if only I'd been more careful.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.240
It doesn't matter now.

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:02.980
Because you're going to make it up to me with a kiss.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:04.140
What?

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:13.290
I'm pretty strong, huh?

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:15.860
I might not look it, but I work out in my own way.

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:18.630
It takes strength and stamina to be an actor, you see.

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.830
F-Futo...

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:24.630
So it's a cinch for me to do this with you, Sis.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:36.610
Say, these photos are quite the scoop, aren't they?

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:37.850
Hikaru...

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:39.150
What's the big idea?

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:41.950
Do you suppose I'll get a lot if I sell them to a weekly magazine?

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:43.510
Quit messing around!

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:47.550
You're the one who's messing around.

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:50.220
You're just a brat. Quit getting carried away.

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:55.900
You've finally shown your true colors.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.870
But you're the master of hiding your true colors, Futo.

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:05.710
Come on, let's go, Little Sister.

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.300
The fireworks are going to start.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.050
Beautiful, isn't it?

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.850
I'm sure it'll be even more beautiful once the fireworks start.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:17.480
Yes, I'm sure.

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:20.690
This is my first time coming to a place like this.

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:24.420
And for it to be a family trip? It's the best.

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:25.730
There you are.

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:27.330
Found you.

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:29.330
You okay walking around already?

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.660
Any pain?

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:32.830
No, I'm fine now.

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:35.370
I'm so glad. Really glad!

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:39.410
It was a certain idiot's fault to begin with,

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:41.440
so keep on feeling responsible forever.

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:42.780
The hell was that, you bastard?!

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:46.010
Shh. You're spoiling the Holy Night.

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:50.520
That's right.
After all, tonight is Christmas Eve.

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:52.780
We're coming up on 10 o'clock exact.

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:02.030
Little Sis.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.100
Yes?

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.760
Merry Christmas!

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:19.940
Merry Christmas to my siblings.

00:20:27.650 --> 00:20:29.320
<i>I can't hear the "I love you"</i>

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:34.460
<i>Why? Why do you end up looking down?</i>

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:37.630
<i>Tired from the excitement, you sleep</i>

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:41.170
<i>Your breathing soft and gentle</i>

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:47.770
<i>I'll stay right here and</i> <i>keep my gaze fixed on you</i>

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:51.180
<i>I shouldn't wake you up, right?</i>

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:54.580
<i>I feel an urge to touch you</i>

00:20:54.580 --> 00:21:01.420
<i>It's because your lips are way too defenseless!</i>

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:08.130
<i>Who are you with in your dream?</i>
<i>(What are you doing?)</i>

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:15.040
<i>I feel as though the jealousy will burn me</i>
<i>(Could it be that you're with those guys?)</i>

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:18.340
<i>Into that place</i>
<i>(Softly, quietly)</i>

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:21.710
<i>I want to sneak in</i>
<i>(It's okay, right?)</i>

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:27.480
<i>Even in a dream, I don't want</i> <i>to let anyone else have you</i>

00:21:27.480 --> 00:21:31.790
<i>I'll shout, "I love you, I love you,"</i> <i>as many times as it takes</i>

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:35.160
<i>I want all of you</i>

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:41.900
<i>Only stolen kisses?</i>
<i>Wrong! Wrong! That's not love</i>

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.330
<i>No matter how tightly I hold you</i>

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:48.740
<i>No matter how passionately I gaze at you</i>

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:50.400
<i>I can't hear the "I love you"</i>

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:55.170
<i>Why do you always end up looking down?</i>

00:21:57.910 --> 00:22:01.250
Fu, I challenge you to see who gets more Valentine's Day chocolates!

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:06.420
You think a civilian like you could win against a star like me?

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.990
I'm popular with the temple's patrons, too, you know.

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:11.020
Those are just charitable donations, right?
